        "instructions": "Choose your race and class, then fight through procedural first-person dungeon floors. Start with the M4, service pistol, and shotgun; elite and boss weapon caches can unlock the scoped Wraith sniper or restore dropped guns. Aim down sights, reload, bash with your equipped weapon, and track enemy health under the reticle. Use grenades or the M4 underbarrel launcher for area damage. Sprint, crouch, slide, lean, jump, and use your race or class abilities to control each fight. Enemies telegraph attacks, and bosses enrage below half health. Collect Gold, earn combat boons, and challenge the campaign bosses. Return to the LuckyStarShip hub to grow offline crops, exchange gold, and repair modules.",
